LiprikonBoot -- a Telegram bot in Lua
=====================================

LiprikonBoot is a Telegram bot written in Lua with the telegram-bot-lua
library.  It answers /ping, /cowsay, /ban and /kick, and /raw_api for a
few raw Bot API calls.

Screenshot:
https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/104227451/176398049-a210d5ac-c583-4174-8d7c-11ad385bc305.png

Requirements
------------

Lua 5.4 and LuaRocks with the luasec, mfr, argparse and
telegram-bot-lua rocks.  The Dockerfile builds an image with all of
them.

Using it
--------

Put the bot's token in TOKEN at the top of main.lua, then run

    lua main.lua

or build and run the Docker image:

    docker build -t liprikonboot .
    docker run liprikonboot

Reporting bugs
--------------

Report bugs at https://github.com/mb6ockatf/liprikontelegram/issues.

